778
00:36:50.490 --> 00:36:51.730
in Long Island, New York.

779
00:36:52.290 --> 00:36:53.150
Hello, ladies.

780
00:36:53.470 --> 00:36:57.930
So I know you've poked fun at Jenna for her actory background prep, but I was wondering,

781
00:36:58.130 --> 00:37:02.570
Angela, how much of a background did you mentally develop for Angela Martin?

782
00:37:03.090 --> 00:37:07.670
Like, I wonder, what happened in her upbringing that made her so particular?

783
00:37:08.770 --> 00:37:10.010
And then Eli B.

784
00:37:10.170 --> 00:37:11.030
from Maryland said,

785
00:37:11.170 --> 00:37:14.430
I'd like to know about Angela Kinsey's backstory for Angela Martin.

