00:44:09.750 --> 00:44:10.130
Yes.

940
00:44:10.290 --> 00:44:11.170
They didn't let you in.

941
00:44:11.350 --> 00:44:12.230
They didn't let me in.

942
00:44:12.330 --> 00:44:12.990
I didn't.

943
00:44:12.990 --> 00:44:14.350
I'm sure I'm not in either.

